## GET /api/stock/{ticker}/unusualness

Volume Unusualness

How unusual the ticker's volume is today vs its own trailing ~90 trading days, as a percentile (0-100)
and decile (1-10) for both regular-session stock volume and total (call + put) option volume. This is
outlier-robust and comparable across names, unlike a raw volume-vs-average ratio. A metric is null when
fewer than 30 trailing days of history are available. Defaults to the last market day.


